  "description": "Have waited a long time to enter this company",
  "body_html": "<p>I have waited about 2 years to enter into this company…as I never buy any stocks right after they IPO. Stocks that just IPO offer significant risk, as you never know which or how many, insiders will dump off their shares. Additionally, I kept noticing, that at the least expected times, the price would go up to news that should have been bad for it. And …</p>",
